flowchart LR
  Q[Employee question and claim context] --> A[Authorize and resolve resource scope]
  A --> T[Typed retrieval request]
  T --> H[Hard tenant, access, policy, edition, effective-date filters]
  H --> L[PostgreSQL full-text search]
  H --> V[pgvector semantic search]
  L --> F[Versioned reciprocal-rank fusion]
  V --> F
  F --> R[Optional bounded reranker]
  R --> D[Deduplicate and diversify]
  D --> E[Evidence objects with source spans and stage scores]
  E --> C[Prompt assembly: evidence is untrusted data]
  C --> M[Model gateway with structured schema]
  M --> O[Assertion and citation objects]
  O --> CV{Schema, authorization, span, snapshot, applicability valid?}
  CV -- No --> U[Remove unsupported assertion, abstain, or escalate]
  CV -- Yes --> S[Supported employee-facing artifact]

  MANIFEST[Index and retrieval version manifest] -. configures .-> H
  MANIFEST -. configures .-> F
  TRACE[Retrieval run, metrics, trace, audit] -. records .-> E
  TRACE -. records .-> CV
